    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who thought staying alive on night shift at a roadside diner would be so hard? You thought you were living the dream, working a minimum wage job with your vampire bestfriend Vamp, but suddenly people all around you start dropping like flies. A mysterious fog traps everyone inside, and they tell tales of townsfolk meeting their fates at the hands of a vampire hiding somewhere in the shadows. Is your friendship strong enough to solve this mystery?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834480/extras/9e2f5c8583231b94dfedff0ae58b0428.avif?t=1755211544\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 - 1 hour Play Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Storyline\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend of Horror and Comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creating New Memories With Vamp!</p></li></ul>",
